'''Bloodgeon''' is the upgraded form of [[Flametal Mace]] using the [[Bloodstone]]. Like all upgraded-weapons that use Bloodstone, its damage is increased by 0.2% for every 1 point of [[health]] the player is missing ''(not to be confused with health percentage)''.

* Its primary attack is a 3-hit attack combo with double damage on the last hit.
* The slower secondary attack deals 2.5x damage and 2x staggering.

An upgraded Flametal Mace will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is crafted into Bloodgeon.

